<h2>Bottom line</h2>
<p>Selling a house with foundation problems in Houston comes down to documentation. Get an independent engineer's report, repair to that plan or price around it, disclose past and present movement honestly, and keep the permit and transferable warranty ready. Then compare repairing, crediting and selling for cash by net proceeds, not by sale price alone.</p>
